tons of scrolls and I must have cleared half a dozen bones levels.
I cleared three leprechaun halls, a cockatrice nest, Mine'sEnd, The
Rat King's level and had all kinds of other adventures besides.

I was really stroming. In the whole game I think I only had to Engrave
